#: includes/inc-botblocker-alerts.php:174
msgid ""
"WP Rocket detected. Add the BotBlocker cookie to the \"Never Cache Cookies\" "
"list in WP Rocket settings. See CACHE-COMPATIBILITY.md."
msgstr ""
"WP Rocket a détecté BotBlocker. Ajoutez le cookie BotBlocker à la liste \" "
"Ne jamais mettre en cache les cookies \" dans les paramètres de WP Rocket. "
"Consultez le fichier CACHE-COMPATIBILITY.md."

#: includes/inc-botblocker-alerts.php:148
msgid ""
"WP Super Cache (Expert/mod_rewrite mode) serves cached pages via .htaccess, "
"bypassing PHP. Add a cookie-based exception. See CACHE-COMPATIBILITY.md."
msgstr ""
"WP Super Cache (mode Expert/mod_rewrite) sert les pages mises en cache via ."
"htaccess, en contournant PHP. Ajouter une exception basée sur les cookies. "
"Voir CACHE-COMPATIBILITY.md."

